      "comment": "Ferigees: The Eternal Oasis",
      "content": "In legend, the Eternal Oasis is an ever-green place ruled by the slumbering Goddess of Flowers, guarded by Ferigees at its gates. King Deshret is said to have built a cemetery for his beloved and made the oasis with the Jinn's help. Ferigees' dying words say it is empty and will crumble.\n\nTribes such as the Tanit call themselves Daughters of the Flower Goddess and seek the oasis. Jeht came to lay her parents' relics there.",
