        "Ferigees"
      ],
      "comment": "Ferigees: Liloupar and Ferigees",
      "content": "Ferigees blames Liloupar for the fall of Gurabad and refuses to let her see their mistress. Liloupar, sealed in a bottle and fragmented as Deshret's punishment, tells her that her bound state is pitiable and asks the Traveler to free her sister from her suffering. Ferigees dies rebuking her, saying nothing is in the tomb but regret. Liloupar answers, \"Farewell, my sister.\"",
