      "comment": "Ferigees: Nameless Tablets",
      "content": "Seven tablets in the Desert of Hadramaveth (readable once the player has Liloupar at power level 7) were written by Liloupar, Ormazd and Ferigees. Ferigees wrote Tablets III and VII: a prayer to Deshret to protect Ay-Khanoum, and a final warning to Kisra to beware of Liloupar.",
